:: Octavia \[Event\] - Two Camps One Chief - Emberclaw Fight [bg-settlement]
<h1 class="ptitle">EMBERCLAW CAMP</h1>
<br />
The ride out is fast and silent, Octavia setting a pace that leaves no room for talk. By the time the treeline breaks and the camp comes into view, the column is already at the perimeter — white armor catching the last of the light.
<br /><br />
<center>
    <<image 'people/octavia/two_camps_emberclaw1.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
<<octavia>>
    On me. We hold the north line — that's where they'll push.
<</octavia>>
<br />
Her warriors fall in around you without needing to be told twice. Whatever this camp is, it's hers, and it shows in the way they move.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Hold the line'>>
    <<set $game.death_reason = 'a White faction blade'>>
    <<generateEnemies 5>>
    <<set $fight.skipEnding = true>>
    <<fight $enemies 'Octavia [Event] - Two Camps One Chief - Aftermath' 'Dead'>>
<</link>>
